# Build and dependency artifacts must never be published here.
#
# This repository distributes the MCP server SOURCE. `dist/` is produced by
# `npm run build` and `node_modules/` by `npm ci`; both are reproduced from
# package-lock.json by any consumer following the README, so committing them would add tens
# of thousands of files that can drift from their sources.
node_modules/
dist/

